## Review priorities

- Owner/course/coursework/submission scoping must be enforced for every read and
  write; no cross-tenant analysis or feedback access.
- Google Classroom Drive attachment selection must use the actual stored
  attachment shape and preserve PDF-first / Google Doc export behavior.
- The existing `app.main` upload/start/snapshot boundary must be reused without
  importing it at module load or duplicating the analysis pipeline.
- EssayCheck output must retain claim/verdict/source evidence, stable citation
  IDs, analysis status/error, and saved review/feedback state.
- Feedback send must remain internal and persist citation IDs; the migration must
  be safe and forward-only.
- Repository parsing must tolerate Supabase-managed columns in `select("*")`
  rows and not construct dataclasses from arbitrary database fields.
- Tests should cover behavior that would regress at the Google/persistence
  boundaries, and the implementation must pass the focused test command.

